@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F9FAFB
skinparam classBorderColor #344054
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
title Compare the recorded light reference
actor "Reviewer" as reviewer
box "Verification tooling - Local design system" #FFF4E5
participant "Reference manifest / fixture" as reference
participant "ComponentGalleryPage" as checks
end box
box "Frontend - Reference and local specimens" #E0F2FE
participant "Reference specimen" as original
participant "Local specimen" as local
end box
reviewer -> reference : Record revision, paths, changes and hashes [L2-031]
reference --> checks : Identified local fixture
checks -> original : Matching content, viewport, browser and fonts
original --> checks : Captures and computed styles
checks -> local : Same content and eight applicable states
local --> checks : Captures and computed styles
alt Unexplained difference or missing state
checks --> reviewer : Comparison remains unaccepted
else Equivalent or explicitly approved accessibility adaptation
checks --> reviewer : Record bounded parity evidence
end
checks -> local : Switch OS theme and simulate old theme preference [L2-032]
local --> checks : Identical light tokens; no theme toggle
reviewer -> reference : Consult component API before future migration [L2-033]
reference --> reviewer : Package/export compatibility remains a later adoption gate
@enduml
